    "title": "Potbelly Sandwich Works",
    "description": "With the Potbelly App, you're just taps away from a hot and toasty sandwich. Plus, when you sign up for Potbelly Perks, you\u2019ll be earning coins towards free food with every order.\r\n\r\n\u2022 A WHOLE NEW POTBELLY PERKS! Now you can save up the coins you earn and choose how you spend them. The more you save the more Perks you can access. Think of it like a Potbelly savings account, only your APY (Annual Perks Yield) is up to you.\r\n\r\n\u2022 DELIVERY AND IN-SHOP PICKUP OPTIONS so you can Potbelly anywhere and bring the good vibes with you. \r\n\r\n\u2022 SKIP THE LINE by ordering ahead. Being hangry is a thing of the past. We'll have your food ready and waiting for you when you get here.\r\n\r\n\u2022 GIVE ME THE USUAL with quick reordering. You're a regular by now so our app knows your order by heart, just a few taps away.     \r\n\r\n\u2022 CUSTOMIZE ORDERS exactly how you like it. Extra pickles? Done. Light mayo? You got it! Extra Hot Peppers? Bring on the Heat! Now THAT'S a sandwich!\r\n\r\n\u2022 CATERING now available on the app so it's easier to feed your crew...or hey, maybe you're just reallllllllly hungry.",
    "descriptionHTML": "With the Potbelly App, you&#39;re just taps away from a hot and toasty sandwich. Plus, when you sign up for Potbelly Perks, you\u2019ll be earning coins towards free food with every order.<br><br>\u2022 A WHOLE NEW POTBELLY PERKS! Now you can save up the coins you earn and choose how you spend them. The more you save the more Perks you can access. Think of it like a Potbelly savings account, only your APY (Annual Perks Yield) is up to you.<br><br>\u2022 DELIVERY AND IN-SHOP PICKUP OPTIONS so you can Potbelly anywhere and bring the good vibes with you. <br><br>\u2022 SKIP THE LINE by ordering ahead. Being hangry is a thing of the past. We&#39;ll have your food ready and waiting for you when you get here.<br><br>\u2022 GIVE ME THE USUAL with quick reordering. You&#39;re a regular by now so our app knows your order by heart, just a few taps away.     <br><br>\u2022 CUSTOMIZE ORDERS exactly how you like it. Extra pickles? Done. Light mayo? You got it! Extra Hot Peppers? Bring on the Heat! Now THAT&#39;S a sandwich!<br><br>\u2022 CATERING now available on the app so it&#39;s easier to feed your crew...or hey, maybe you&#39;re just reallllllllly hungry.",
